    "title": "E-Pedometer: Step Tracker",
    "description": "Get fit and shed pounds with E-Pedometer! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0b Accurate & Battery-Saving \r\nAuto track steps without GPS, sign-in, or Wi-Fi. Minimal battery consumption with built-in sensor usage.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Easy-to-Use \r\nFree pedometer with automatic start and stop. Works accurately in pocket or bag.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12 Free & Private \r\nNo sign-in needed. We prioritize your privacy\u2014no data collection or sharing.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcca Report Graphs \r\nVisualize steps, distance, time, and calories daily, weekly, and monthly.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Set Personal Goals \r\nTailor daily goals based on age, weight, etc. Monitor progress with run tracker and graphs.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Health & Fitness \r\nReliable Android pedometer for daily health monitoring. Compatible with all Android devices.\r\n\r\nDownload now for step, calorie, distance, and run tracking. Walk towards better health effortlessly. \r\n\r\nThanks for using E-Pedometer: Step Tracker! \u2764\ufe0f",
